rooms_desc ({"You are standing on a street in the middle of the Roman Empireyou can see many tall buildings and can also hear loud cheeringto the south of you","This is where the Roman Senate meets to pass laws. There isa large area in the middle of the room where you can stand and address them. ","You have entered a great arena where people do combat to the death.The crowd cheers as you step into the arena. You get the feelingthat you will soon be engaged in mortal combat","This seems to be a place where people drop things why they goout to look at the wounders of Rome. You can put your thingshere and come back for them when you are ready to leave.","You are standing on a dock where the Roman Ships come in andout. There is a great deal of activity going on. It seems tolook like Roman troops are going over seas. You cant help butwounder where they are going.","You are standing in the inner chamber of the Roman Senate. thisis the area where the senate rests between meetings. there aremany places to sit and rest. You feel very comfortable here.","You are standing in Senator Akira's inner chamber. This is wherehe rests after passing judgment. This room seems to be very nicebut you can tell that Akira passes judgment because he likes itand he's not just in it for the power.","This is the area where the warriors who will be fighting in thearena wait before they go out to die. The smell of fear fillsthe room","This is where Akira the Vagabond Guildwarrior waits for hisnext opponet to enter the arena. The room is well kept andyou feel safe just being in it.","You have entered the city's prison.  After passing judgement on the peons whoinhabit the Holy Roman Empire, Akira sends the guilty parties to this chamber.  On the walls you can see the decayed and bloodied remains of the guilty parties who have been sentanced by Akira and were once chained to the walls.  You almost slip in the puddles of blood which seem to cover the floor at everyturn.  Something (maybe the fearsome and gigantic guards who watch yourevery move) makes you want to leave this place immediately.",})
